WEBVTT

01:30.340 --> 01:33.578
=Against The Current=

01:33.579 --> 01:35.000
(Adapted from He Yanshan's novel,
Orchid Fragrance Fate)

01:35.180 --> 01:36.920
=Episode 24=
(This drama does not correspond)

01:36.930 --> 01:38.200
(to any real historical dynasty.)

01:38.210 --> 01:41.160
(The systems, culture, attire and other
dynastic elements have been adapted.)

01:44.540 --> 01:46.380
(Zhenhuai Gate)

01:51.480 --> 01:52.040
Hyah!

02:04.220 --> 02:08.020
♪If there were a promise♪

02:08.460 --> 02:12.380
♪Could I still refuse with a smile?♪

02:12.740 --> 02:16.260
♪Sadly, things did not go as I wished♪

02:17.180 --> 02:20.580
♪Yet I still
have to smile through it all♪

02:20.900 --> 02:23.060
♪Those things I cannot forget♪

02:23.060 --> 02:27.380
♪The absurdities
I cannot let go of fill the pages♪

02:27.380 --> 02:29.340
♪Building a wall♪

02:29.340 --> 02:33.100
♪Trapping me in the midst of time♪

02:33.448 --> 02:34.980
(Order of the Commander
of the Shence Garrison)

02:34.980 --> 02:36.820
♪Drifting with the wind♪

02:37.300 --> 02:41.740
♪Etched upon my heart♪

02:49.080 --> 02:50.400
- Hurry!
- Quickly!

02:50.520 --> 02:51.630
(Qingyan House)
Hurry!

03:01.420 --> 03:04.980
(Intoxicated Moon in the Mist)

03:05.800 --> 03:06.680
Young Master.

03:07.360 --> 03:09.680
All the young ladies here are present.

04:00.439 --> 04:03.039
The young lady you're looking
for ran away long ago.

04:04.000 --> 04:05.000
Look, Young Master.

04:05.360 --> 04:06.680
Just to find her,

04:07.000 --> 04:08.120
I sent almost all

04:08.120 --> 04:09.919
the guards out searching.

04:10.120 --> 04:12.120
Only we women are left here.

04:13.280 --> 04:13.919
Young Master.

04:14.328 --> 04:15.430
We've searched everywhere.

04:15.430 --> 04:16.670
We couldn't find Young Lady Xu.

04:16.680 --> 04:17.990
While I was keeping watch outside,

04:18.040 --> 04:19.896
I heard them shouting
that she had escaped.

04:20.280 --> 04:21.430
I saw the brothel servants

04:21.448 --> 04:23.144
leave with the guards to search for her.

04:31.079 --> 04:32.079
What

04:33.639 --> 04:34.879
did you do to her?

04:37.040 --> 04:40.000
That young lady is even better
at sweet-talking than a man.

04:40.759 --> 04:42.680
She said she was a rare prize

04:42.728 --> 04:44.560
and that I should
wait for the highest offer,

04:44.639 --> 04:46.279
promising to make me a fortune.

04:46.560 --> 04:48.519
She had me completely delighted.

04:48.959 --> 04:51.199
I gave her the best food
and drink for a whole day.

04:51.199 --> 04:52.040
But when I

04:52.040 --> 04:54.519
invited all
the wealthy merchants in Yangzhou,

04:54.519 --> 04:55.959
she actually ran away.

05:05.639 --> 05:07.040
Didn't you send guards after her?

05:07.192 --> 05:08.070
Did they catch her?

05:08.680 --> 05:09.439
Young Master.

05:10.319 --> 05:12.519
That young lady
is as slippery as an eel.

05:12.959 --> 05:14.920
She's probably long gone from the city.

05:15.800 --> 05:17.199
If you're looking for her,

05:17.439 --> 05:19.519
you might want
to ask the local authorities.

05:19.800 --> 05:20.920
She has no travel permit,

05:21.279 --> 05:22.399
so she can't board a boat

05:22.800 --> 05:23.920
or take a carriage.

05:24.519 --> 05:25.800
Chances are

05:25.800 --> 05:28.399
the constables will catch her
and bring her back.

05:29.560 --> 05:30.680
You should be grateful

05:31.199 --> 05:32.079
that she escaped.

05:35.040 --> 05:36.519
Take care, Young Master.

05:41.519 --> 05:42.199
Young Lady.

05:44.399 --> 05:45.079
Young Lady.

05:48.160 --> 05:49.040
Because of him,

05:50.160 --> 05:51.680
I've ended up like this,

05:54.639 --> 05:56.040
yet he doesn't even remember

05:56.040 --> 05:56.879
what I look like.

06:02.639 --> 06:04.319
He doesn't remember who I am at all.

06:18.759 --> 06:19.519
Young Lady.

06:33.160 --> 06:34.560
Young Lady Shuang.

06:37.160 --> 06:38.920
You betrayed me first,

06:40.079 --> 06:42.800
so don't blame me
for turning against you.

07:18.488 --> 07:20.630
Without a travel permit,
she can't board a boat.

07:20.800 --> 07:22.160
She should be easy to find.

07:23.319 --> 07:24.439
Once we get the reward,

07:24.800 --> 07:27.040
let's go drink at Qingyan House.

07:40.264 --> 07:42.510
If someone without
a travel permit tries to board a boat,

07:42.776 --> 07:44.240
report it to the authorities at once.

07:44.408 --> 07:45.928
There's a reward for reporting them.

07:46.439 --> 07:47.600
- All right.
- Sure!

07:56.879 --> 08:04.279
♪Who dares predict
tomorrow's rain or shine?♪

08:04.439 --> 08:07.800
♪A sudden clap of spring thunder♪

08:08.040 --> 08:11.439
♪With wealth and children♪

08:11.839 --> 08:17.399
♪Free from trouble and strife♪

08:17.560 --> 08:23.199
♪Who dares say?♪

08:23.519 --> 08:31.720
♪No one dares say♪

08:32.080 --> 08:41.799
♪No one dares say♪

09:17.559 --> 09:19.679
Scholar Han, Furong.

09:20.159 --> 09:21.399
Why are you here?

09:23.679 --> 09:25.039
We came to take you home.

10:00.799 --> 10:02.519
I knew a clever girl like you

10:02.679 --> 10:04.440
would find a way out of danger.

10:07.919 --> 10:09.559
How did you know I was in Yangzhou?

10:10.039 --> 10:11.320
Commander Lin found out

10:11.840 --> 10:13.919
that this misfortune
befell you because of him.

10:14.000 --> 10:16.740
He also said the person behind it was
beyond even his power to confront.

10:16.759 --> 10:17.919
So I went to Furong

10:18.168 --> 10:19.960
to ask about
the powerful and influential.

10:20.360 --> 10:22.744
There are always plenty
of people talking at the theater,

10:22.776 --> 10:24.888
and our troupe often
performs at private residences.

10:25.159 --> 10:26.159
If we pay attention,

10:26.440 --> 10:28.200
we can learn a great deal.

10:28.904 --> 10:30.968
Recently, the young lady
of Duke Xianguo's family

10:31.000 --> 10:32.910
has been discussing marriage
with Commander Lin.

10:33.399 --> 10:35.679
That matched what happened to you.

10:37.440 --> 10:38.919
Once we knew the person who harmed you

10:38.920 --> 10:40.904
was the young lady
of Duke Xianguo's family,

10:41.200 --> 10:43.679
we could guess what she intended to do.

10:44.759 --> 10:45.679
The closest places

10:45.840 --> 10:48.639
to Jinling are Yangzhou Prefecture
and Zhenjiang Prefecture.

10:49.799 --> 10:50.919
After discussing it,

10:51.399 --> 10:52.440
Furong and I

10:52.552 --> 10:54.184
came to Yangzhou to look for you.

10:54.559 --> 10:55.840
Mister Lu and Uncle Xu

10:55.992 --> 10:57.448
went to Zhenjiang to look for you.

11:00.232 --> 11:02.510
You've both gone to
a lot of trouble for me this time.

11:04.399 --> 11:05.440
Scholar Han

11:06.039 --> 11:07.679
especially went to great lengths.

11:12.399 --> 11:13.320
Our families

11:13.480 --> 11:14.750
live next door to each other

11:15.320 --> 11:17.039
and have always been as close as family.

11:17.639 --> 11:19.799
We're family, so there's no need
for such formalities.

11:21.799 --> 11:22.320
All right.

11:23.159 --> 11:25.279
I won't stand on ceremony, then.

11:35.919 --> 11:38.320
This Young Lady Zheng is rather strange.

11:38.919 --> 11:40.519
She's never even met you.

11:40.679 --> 11:42.320
Why would she resent you so much?

11:44.919 --> 11:47.440
I just heard
your father call you Lanxiang.

11:49.039 --> 11:51.159
I imagine this orchid
has some connection to you.

11:52.120 --> 11:53.600
Won't you miss it?

11:55.799 --> 11:57.039
We did meet once.

11:57.240 --> 11:59.320
I'm afraid
there was some misunderstanding.

11:59.440 --> 12:02.159
She mistakenly thought I was standing
in the way of her marriage.

12:05.064 --> 12:06.584
Even if there was a misunderstanding,

12:06.590 --> 12:08.390
she should have taken it up
with Commander Lin.

12:08.399 --> 12:09.879
What right did she have to frame you?

12:10.200 --> 12:11.559
She relies on her wealth and power

12:11.624 --> 12:13.512
and treats us
all like insects beneath her feet,

12:13.520 --> 12:15.816
trampling on us as she pleases.
It's truly infuriating.

12:16.759 --> 12:17.559
That day,

12:17.559 --> 12:19.559
if something had really
happened to you on stage,

12:20.000 --> 12:21.399
our troupe would've been finished.

12:21.768 --> 12:23.270
Taking away someone's livelihood

12:23.304 --> 12:25.000
is no different from taking their life.

12:26.039 --> 12:28.399
Fortunately, Lanxiang
thought quickly on her feet.

12:28.679 --> 12:31.039
Otherwise, my reputation
would've been completely ruined,

12:31.799 --> 12:34.559
and I would've had no chance
of an official career ever again.

12:36.232 --> 12:39.000
They say yielding a step
opens up a world of possibilities.

12:40.159 --> 12:41.399
But this Young Lady Zheng

12:42.080 --> 12:43.279
has gone far too far

12:44.080 --> 12:45.519
and left us nowhere to retreat.

12:55.080 --> 12:56.759
We can't just let this go.

12:57.480 --> 12:59.039
We have to seek justice.

13:00.200 --> 13:01.720
We have neither power nor influence.

13:02.840 --> 13:05.080
How can we seek justice
from a duke's daughter?

13:06.840 --> 13:09.559
Don't they say justice
lives in people's hearts?

13:10.039 --> 13:12.440
If the authorities
won't uphold justice for us,

13:12.600 --> 13:13.440
then we

13:14.168 --> 13:15.790
will ask the people what they think.

13:17.559 --> 13:19.759
Ask the people?

13:42.120 --> 13:43.559
Slow down.

13:43.559 --> 13:44.799
You'll choke.

14:02.320 --> 14:03.120
Have some tea.

14:07.519 --> 14:08.279
Here.

14:09.559 --> 14:11.440
Take your time. There's more in the pot.

14:30.600 --> 14:31.279
Mother.

14:32.720 --> 14:34.039
How much money do we have left?

14:34.759 --> 14:35.720
You need money?

14:38.080 --> 14:39.559
If Ji'er hadn't saved me,

14:40.559 --> 14:41.879
I never would've escaped.

14:42.799 --> 14:43.759
I promised her

14:44.039 --> 14:45.559
I'd go back and buy her freedom.

14:49.000 --> 14:50.200
Three hundred and eighty taels.

14:50.440 --> 14:51.200
Is that enough?

14:53.799 --> 14:54.600
No.

14:54.872 --> 14:56.600
We'll need at least five hundred taels.

15:01.879 --> 15:02.720
Don't worry.

15:04.120 --> 15:06.456
Wait until your father and Mister Lu

15:06.460 --> 15:08.600
return from Zhenjiang Prefecture
in a couple of days.

15:08.799 --> 15:10.440
We'll find a way to borrow some.

15:11.799 --> 15:12.840
Don't worry.

15:13.240 --> 15:14.879
Ji'er saved you.

15:15.080 --> 15:17.200
Even if we have
to sell everything we own,

15:17.519 --> 15:19.000
we'll get her out too.

15:22.720 --> 15:23.559
Once

15:24.360 --> 15:26.039
we get Ji'er out,

15:27.039 --> 15:28.759
if she wants to find her parents

15:28.799 --> 15:29.960
and her younger brother,

15:30.480 --> 15:32.120
we'll help her look for them.

15:34.559 --> 15:35.639
If she doesn't,

15:36.039 --> 15:37.279
she can stay

15:37.440 --> 15:38.600
and be my daughter.

15:38.720 --> 15:40.000
You two can be sisters

15:40.080 --> 15:41.240
and keep each other company.

15:43.080 --> 15:43.759
All right.

15:43.879 --> 15:45.240
We'll do as you say, Mother.

15:48.200 --> 15:49.600
I'll get you another bowl of rice.

15:50.480 --> 15:51.279
I'm full.

15:51.280 --> 15:52.792
I'll be stuffed if I eat any more.

15:53.720 --> 15:54.279
Really!

15:54.279 --> 15:55.440
Leave it. I'll do it.

15:55.559 --> 15:56.039
Sit here.

15:56.039 --> 15:57.120
Drink your tea.

16:20.120 --> 16:21.039
What is it?

16:40.720 --> 16:41.799
Furong said

16:42.639 --> 16:44.279
the star courtesans in Yangzhou City

16:44.559 --> 16:45.559
don't come cheap.

16:45.992 --> 16:47.496
This is the money my sister and I

16:47.879 --> 16:49.360
pooled together with Furong.

16:49.799 --> 16:50.799
Take it for now.

16:54.000 --> 16:55.039
Saving her comes first.

16:55.039 --> 16:56.279
You can pay us back slowly.

17:00.480 --> 17:01.279
Mother and I

17:01.279 --> 17:03.080
were just talking about borrowing money,

17:03.360 --> 17:04.759
and now you've brought us some.

17:09.240 --> 17:10.440
Then I won't stand on ceremony.

17:10.960 --> 17:12.039
I'll take it for now.

17:24.559 --> 17:25.440
Wait.

17:42.119 --> 17:43.359
I'll go put it somewhere safe.

17:43.519 --> 17:44.079
All right.

17:46.504 --> 17:47.790
I'll take this to the kitchen.

17:47.790 --> 17:49.590
We can eat it together
when Mother gets back.

17:55.559 --> 17:58.079
Furong asked me to tell you something.

17:59.559 --> 18:00.880
At a place like Qingyan House,

18:00.936 --> 18:03.480
it would be difficult for a young lady
like you to handle things,

18:04.360 --> 18:06.584
especially since you've
already crossed the madam.

18:07.039 --> 18:08.519
You might only make matters worse.

18:09.272 --> 18:10.960
It's better to wait
for Uncle Xu to return

18:11.319 --> 18:13.799
and have him
go to Yangzhou with Mister Lu.

18:14.559 --> 18:15.960
With Scholar Zongbai's reputation,

18:16.440 --> 18:17.720
they'll surely be able to bring

18:17.759 --> 18:18.640
your savior back.

18:23.039 --> 18:24.599
Furong has a point.

18:25.279 --> 18:26.759
It would be safer

18:26.904 --> 18:28.472
for Mister Lu and my father to go.

18:32.759 --> 18:33.759
Have you decided

18:34.376 --> 18:36.030
what to do about Young Lady Zheng?

18:57.640 --> 19:10.119
♪Turning right and wrong upside down♪

19:10.240 --> 19:18.519
♪Doing evil without restraint♪

19:18.680 --> 19:25.359
♪You make a mockery of the law♪

19:25.759 --> 19:36.079
♪You corrupt all moral order♪

19:36.880 --> 19:49.279
♪My Lord, do not believe
these slanderous words♪

19:49.279 --> 19:51.460
♪My thoughts are like a red umbrella♪

19:51.980 --> 19:54.060
♪Drifting through the rain♪

19:54.420 --> 19:59.500
♪Held tightly in my hand,
shielding me from hidden currents♪

19:59.500 --> 20:04.580
♪Yet fate stains my sleeves with blood♪

20:07.680 --> 20:09.800
Young Master, aren't you
going in to see Lanxiang?

20:09.912 --> 20:11.200
Chengze is still waiting for me.

20:11.200 --> 20:13.112
Let's take care
of the important matter first.

20:15.839 --> 20:20.200
♪Fabricating lies to ruin her good name♪

20:20.839 --> 20:27.200
♪Killing without spilling
a drop of blood♪

20:27.200 --> 20:33.300
♪I'd spend this life
and call it courage♪

20:39.559 --> 20:43.680
♪My Lord, uphold justice♪

20:43.880 --> 20:50.279
♪Tell right from wrong
and judge what is just♪

20:52.039 --> 20:52.839
Well said!

21:03.440 --> 21:04.559
I've made up my mind.

21:08.880 --> 21:10.200
For Marquis Yongchang's wedding,

21:10.440 --> 21:12.960
was Furong invited to perform
The Tale of the Treasure Chest?

21:13.799 --> 21:14.359
Yes.

21:15.039 --> 21:16.559
The Crown Prince enjoys opera,

21:17.279 --> 21:19.759
especially popular plays
about everyday life.

21:20.312 --> 21:22.790
So Marquis Yongchang
chose The Tale of the Treasure Chest

21:23.039 --> 21:24.119
for the Crown Prince.

21:25.079 --> 21:27.799
I hear many nobles want
to go to Marquis Yongchang's Residence

21:28.559 --> 21:30.039
just to see the play.

21:32.519 --> 21:33.359
Perfect.

21:34.559 --> 21:35.799
Then we'll

21:36.559 --> 21:39.599
use the play to stage a play of our own.

21:42.552 --> 21:44.200
Use the play to stage a play of our own?

22:04.559 --> 22:06.440
Once we bring Ji'er back,

22:07.279 --> 22:08.839
I should talk to Madam Han again

22:08.839 --> 22:10.680
about the marriage between those two.

22:23.060 --> 22:26.460
(Marquis Yongchang's Residence)

22:41.740 --> 22:44.860
♪In spring, my heart
sets out filled with hope♪

22:44.860 --> 22:46.620
♪For all the tenderness in this world♪

22:48.960 --> 22:52.000
Please have the bride
and groom drink the nuptial wine.

22:54.599 --> 22:55.440
Please.

22:56.839 --> 22:57.359
Please.

22:57.359 --> 22:59.900
♪Though summer brings
its share of hardships♪

22:59.900 --> 23:01.940
♪I still struggle
through the wind and rain♪

23:01.940 --> 23:03.660
♪My spirit remains undaunted♪

23:04.020 --> 23:07.180
♪Daring to press on, daring to fight♪

23:07.580 --> 23:09.980
♪Riding with the wind♪

23:10.079 --> 23:11.039
What's this?

23:11.624 --> 23:13.416
Dates and chestnuts.
[*Have a child early.]

23:15.960 --> 23:17.319
First, scatter the fruits.

23:18.119 --> 23:20.880
May the newlyweds
share a blissful bridal chamber.

23:23.799 --> 23:25.119
Second, scatter the fruits.

23:26.559 --> 23:29.240
May two red candles shine
upon the loving pair.

23:30.720 --> 23:32.039
Third, scatter the fruits.

23:32.519 --> 23:34.880
May three cups of fine wine
be raised to the groom.

23:36.200 --> 23:37.519
Fourth, scatter the fruits.

23:38.279 --> 23:41.279
May the flowered bridal sedan
carry the bride to her new home.

23:43.440 --> 23:44.839
Fifth, scatter the fruits.

23:45.119 --> 23:48.000
May five worthy sons achieve honors
in the imperial examinations.

23:51.799 --> 23:53.240
Sixth, scatter the fruits.

23:53.720 --> 23:56.480
May you rise to greatness
like Su Qin, who served the six states.

23:59.559 --> 24:00.799
Seventh, scatter the fruits.

24:01.799 --> 24:04.440
May seven celestial maidens
accompany the bride.

24:05.079 --> 24:06.519
Eighth, scatter the fruits.

24:06.880 --> 24:09.440
May the Eight Immortals
bring blessings to your home.

24:10.079 --> 24:11.519
Ninth, scatter the fruits.

24:11.640 --> 24:14.279
May nine generations
live together in harmony.

24:14.559 --> 24:16.079
Tenth, scatter the fruits.

24:16.880 --> 24:20.039
May ten generations of descendants
serve and safeguard the realm.

24:21.039 --> 24:22.799
May Your Lordship and your wife

24:22.880 --> 24:24.079
share a loving marriage

24:24.079 --> 24:26.240
and grow old together.

24:26.344 --> 24:28.200
- A loving marriage.
- A loving marriage.

24:28.200 --> 24:29.960
- Grow old together.
- Grow old together.

24:43.039 --> 24:43.519
My Lady.

24:43.960 --> 24:44.920
Get some rest.

24:45.288 --> 24:46.440
I'll go see to the guests.

24:47.880 --> 24:49.079
Go ahead, Your Lordship.

25:12.584 --> 25:14.632
Just as Your Lordship
and Young Master Lin expected,

25:14.648 --> 25:16.340
Duke Xianguo chose
to make his move today.

25:16.350 --> 25:18.260
He has stationed
a large force outside the residence.

25:18.270 --> 25:20.568
It looks like he has no intention
of letting the Crown Prince

25:20.570 --> 25:21.650
leave the residence alive.

25:22.240 --> 25:23.359
Does Fengtai know?

25:23.799 --> 25:24.599
Yes.

25:26.880 --> 25:27.559
♪My Lord♪

25:28.039 --> 25:29.119
♪Let me tell you instead♪

25:29.359 --> 25:30.279
♪Her name is Tanniang♪

25:30.319 --> 25:31.319
♪She's a widow♪

25:31.320 --> 25:33.480
♪She should have remained
faithful to her late husband♪

25:33.496 --> 25:34.960
♪Yet she tried to seduce me♪

25:35.000 --> 25:36.170
♪But I refused her advances♪

25:36.279 --> 25:37.200
♪Who would've thought♪

25:37.400 --> 25:39.240
♪She would set
her sights on my treasure♪

25:39.400 --> 25:41.680
♪My pearl-threaded golden robe♪

25:41.680 --> 25:43.920
♪My Lord, utter nonsense♪

25:44.079 --> 25:46.279
♪He tried to force himself on me♪

25:46.279 --> 25:47.799
♪But I refused♪

25:47.799 --> 25:50.960
♪So this scoundrel held a grudge♪

25:50.960 --> 25:53.680
♪When one scheme failed,
he devised another♪

25:53.799 --> 25:56.359
♪And tried to frame me♪

25:58.440 --> 26:01.599
♪This is a court of law.
I will not tolerate such insolence!♪

26:01.640 --> 26:03.039
♪Guards♪

26:03.039 --> 26:05.200
♪Open the chest at once♪

26:05.200 --> 26:08.039
♪And let me examine it carefully♪

26:08.240 --> 26:10.519
♪To see if there are any clothes inside♪

26:10.519 --> 26:11.039
♪There are♪

26:11.039 --> 26:12.200
♪There are none♪

26:12.359 --> 26:14.839
♪Why should anyone believe
this wretched woman's words?♪

26:14.920 --> 26:17.400
♪Curse Guo Qiu, you vile beast♪

26:17.400 --> 26:19.559
♪You vile beast♪

26:29.912 --> 26:32.540
(Chen Shaoxin, Yuan Shaohui's Mother,
Old Madam of the Yuan Family)

26:32.540 --> 26:34.744
(Yuan Jiarong, Yuan Shaohui's
Eldest Daughter, Age Twelve)

26:36.880 --> 26:39.440
Manyi, you've
always lived in the capital.

26:39.544 --> 26:41.960
You're accustomed to refined
northern opera and court music.

26:42.319 --> 26:44.440
Can you get used to

26:44.440 --> 26:45.759
our more popular southern opera?

26:47.440 --> 26:48.799
I was born in Jinling.

26:48.799 --> 26:50.039
Why wouldn't I be used to it?

26:50.519 --> 26:52.319
Besides, Emperor Shengzu once said

26:52.599 --> 26:54.240
Gao Ming's The Story of the Lute

26:54.240 --> 26:55.559
is like the finest delicacies,

26:55.592 --> 26:57.480
something no noble household
should be without.

26:58.599 --> 27:01.000
Clearly, neither northern
nor southern opera is superior.

27:01.200 --> 27:03.319
It all depends on
the skill of the playwright.

27:04.584 --> 27:06.504
Take The Tale
of the Treasure Chest before us.

27:06.799 --> 27:08.039
It was written by Lu Zongbai.

27:08.440 --> 27:09.559
Its lyrics are elegant,

27:09.656 --> 27:11.640
which is why it belongs
on the finest stages.

27:13.599 --> 27:14.720
Just look

27:16.200 --> 27:20.000
at her bearing, speech,
and breadth of knowledge.

27:20.440 --> 27:22.720
As expected
of someone raised in the palace.

27:23.200 --> 27:24.880
Old Madam is quite right.

27:25.640 --> 27:27.000
A young lady like Manyi

27:27.240 --> 27:29.599
is what a truly
well-bred young lady should be.

27:32.319 --> 27:33.640
You flatter her, Old Madam.

27:33.832 --> 27:36.030
It's all thanks
to Dowager Consort Zheng's guidance.

27:38.880 --> 27:42.640
♪Fabricating lies to ruin her good name♪

27:43.240 --> 27:49.720
♪Killing without
spilling a drop of blood♪

28:04.344 --> 28:05.110
Your Highness.

28:05.559 --> 28:06.200
I arrived late.

28:06.319 --> 28:08.000
Today is your wedding day.

28:08.088 --> 28:09.240
No need for formalities.

28:10.960 --> 28:11.599
Chengze.

28:12.119 --> 28:14.319
You should offer
your brother-in-law a proper toast.

28:15.799 --> 28:16.839
You weren't here earlier.

28:17.000 --> 28:18.920
He was the one
helping receive the guests.

28:21.279 --> 28:22.519
I shall obey Your Highness.

28:24.720 --> 28:27.039
Commander Lin is a few years
younger than the Marquis,

28:27.144 --> 28:28.840
yet now he's become his brother-in-law.

28:36.552 --> 28:37.960
Thank you for your help today.

28:39.200 --> 28:40.799
We're family. It's only right.

28:41.480 --> 28:43.559
♪If everything she says is true♪

28:43.559 --> 28:47.319
♪I beg you to find him guilty♪

28:47.880 --> 28:48.440
♪My Lord♪

28:48.880 --> 28:50.079
♪Find her guilty♪

28:50.279 --> 28:53.480
♪Say no more. One look will tell♪

28:53.640 --> 28:54.799
♪- Guards
- Yes♪

28:54.799 --> 28:56.839
♪Open the chest at once♪

28:56.839 --> 28:57.440
♪Good♪

29:26.480 --> 29:35.799
- Good!
- Good!

29:38.319 --> 29:41.200
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

29:41.720 --> 29:44.599
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

29:44.839 --> 29:48.240
♪There's a ghost in the chest♪

30:12.000 --> 30:12.680
Manyi.

30:17.736 --> 30:19.160
What a wonderful performance.

30:19.599 --> 30:21.359
I simply couldn't help myself.

30:23.519 --> 30:24.319
Forgive my manners.

30:29.920 --> 30:30.599
What's wrong?

30:31.599 --> 30:33.039
There's a ghost in the play.

30:36.720 --> 30:38.559
I have to go catch the ghost.

30:52.319 --> 30:53.519
So it really is Young Lady Xu.

30:56.880 --> 30:58.079
I should've known.

30:59.480 --> 31:01.400
She's not one
to let others mistreat her.

31:07.384 --> 31:08.830
I'll have to trouble you, Chengze.

31:09.599 --> 31:10.880
Make sure she stays safe.

31:14.039 --> 31:14.480
All right.

31:28.264 --> 31:29.030
Your Highness.

31:29.528 --> 31:30.960
After escorting the bride here,

31:30.970 --> 31:33.070
we must return and report
to our parents and elders,

31:33.112 --> 31:34.980
and inform our ancestors
at the ancestral hall.

31:35.016 --> 31:36.440
So we must take our leave first

31:36.720 --> 31:38.400
and cannot remain
at Your Highness's side.

31:38.488 --> 31:39.880
Please forgive us, Your Highness.

31:42.568 --> 31:43.990
Those are our ancestral family rules.

31:44.200 --> 31:45.240
It's only right.

31:45.799 --> 31:46.599
You may go.

31:48.039 --> 31:48.640
Yes.

31:55.240 --> 31:55.960
♪Guards♪

31:56.200 --> 32:00.359
♪Take this guilty woman
and throw her in jail♪

32:06.079 --> 32:13.559
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

32:18.640 --> 32:19.319
Chengze.

32:19.839 --> 32:20.920
Make the arrangements.

32:21.599 --> 32:22.839
I want to take the stage

32:23.112 --> 32:25.016
and play the Mountain Deity
who upholds justice

32:25.032 --> 32:27.070
in the final act
of The Tale of the Treasure Chest.

32:30.039 --> 32:30.640
Your Highness.

32:31.200 --> 32:33.559
I don't think this is appropriate.

32:37.960 --> 32:38.680
Duke Xianguo.

32:39.720 --> 32:40.640
What do you think?

32:42.599 --> 32:43.440
I...

32:43.992 --> 32:45.350
also think it's inappropriate.

32:47.359 --> 32:49.160
I'll be playing a deity onstage.

32:49.208 --> 32:51.350
That doesn't violate
Emperor Shengzu's teachings.

32:51.512 --> 32:52.680
What's inappropriate about it?

32:54.888 --> 32:55.510
Your Highness...

32:55.519 --> 32:56.480
This is a rare occasion.

32:56.880 --> 32:58.000
My mind is made up.

32:58.184 --> 32:59.590
If you try to dissuade me again,

33:00.440 --> 33:01.640
I'll return to the palace.

33:03.592 --> 33:04.750
On this joyous occasion,

33:04.760 --> 33:06.990
it's rare for the Crown Prince
to be in such high spirits.

33:07.480 --> 33:09.559
We wouldn't dare spoil your enjoyment.

33:13.119 --> 33:13.839
Chengze.

33:15.319 --> 33:16.920
Even Duke Xianguo has agreed.

33:20.264 --> 33:21.720
I'll make the arrangements at once.

33:37.160 --> 33:37.839
Your Highness.

33:38.119 --> 33:40.039
It's just around the corner.

33:45.112 --> 33:46.960
With so many people watching the play,

33:47.112 --> 33:48.552
why are you the only one who thinks

33:48.584 --> 33:50.680
I was pretending
to be a ghost to frighten you?

33:51.759 --> 33:53.599
There's an old saying.

33:54.160 --> 33:55.680
If you've done nothing wrong,

33:55.750 --> 33:57.976
you needn't fear
a ghost knocking at midnight.

33:58.720 --> 34:00.519
If you had nothing to hide,

34:02.280 --> 34:04.720
why would you be afraid
of me pretending to be a ghost?

34:07.599 --> 34:10.079
There's another old
saying that's even better.

34:10.519 --> 34:12.719
Money can make
even a ghost turn a millstone.

34:13.920 --> 34:15.519
I have wealth and power.

34:15.760 --> 34:17.320
I can catch ghosts and destroy them,

34:17.496 --> 34:19.230
even make them
turn the millstones for me.

34:20.239 --> 34:21.199
But you...

34:26.239 --> 34:27.840
can only be a ghost.

34:34.320 --> 34:36.400
I refuse to believe
there is no law in this land.

34:37.320 --> 34:38.519
Scholar Han said

34:39.079 --> 34:40.559
you sent men to abduct me

34:40.719 --> 34:42.320
and are suspected of human trafficking.

34:42.320 --> 34:43.880
You've violated the laws of our dynasty.

34:44.239 --> 34:45.400
It's a serious crime.

34:45.840 --> 34:47.320
Rites do not extend to commoners,

34:47.848 --> 34:49.590
and punishments do not reach officials.

34:50.519 --> 34:52.000
Do you understand what that means?

34:53.150 --> 34:54.984
Rites are made
for those with understanding,

34:55.039 --> 34:56.840
while punishments
are meant for the ignorant.

34:57.599 --> 34:59.519
An ignorant commoner like you

34:59.800 --> 35:01.719
has no right
to lecture me about the law.

35:04.239 --> 35:06.159
Of course there is law in this land.

35:08.079 --> 35:10.079
I am the law to you.

35:13.128 --> 35:14.590
My daughter is talking nonsense.

35:14.712 --> 35:16.190
I failed to teach her properly.

35:16.639 --> 35:17.360
I am at fault.

35:28.320 --> 35:29.360
Xu Lanxiang.

35:33.679 --> 35:34.320
You...

35:37.768 --> 35:39.192
If Dai Sheng and Ban Gu knew

35:39.240 --> 35:42.030
this was how you interpreted
the Book of Rites and Baihu Tongyi,

35:42.872 --> 35:44.800
they would surely
come knocking at midnight

35:45.039 --> 35:46.679
to teach you how to behave.

35:54.199 --> 35:55.280
Ladies,

35:55.559 --> 35:57.719
please follow me to see the Crown Prince.

35:57.720 --> 35:58.888
(Wang Cheng,
Attendant to the Crown Prince)

36:15.320 --> 36:18.360
I never expected this to be one
of Fengtai's romantic entanglements.

36:19.000 --> 36:20.760
If I'd known, I would've made him stay.

36:26.159 --> 36:27.880
It was all my reckless doing.

36:28.024 --> 36:29.784
My father had nothing to do with it.

36:30.519 --> 36:31.760
Please punish me, Your Highness.

36:34.239 --> 36:36.519
Today is Chengze's wedding day.

36:36.800 --> 36:37.840
You're a guest, too.

36:38.599 --> 36:40.159
Go back and enjoy the play.

36:40.952 --> 36:42.840
Tomorrow, report
to the Ministry of Justice

36:43.199 --> 36:44.400
and turn yourself in.

36:44.504 --> 36:46.392
You will be dealt
with according to the law.

36:53.208 --> 36:55.016
Thank you for your mercy, Your Highness.

36:55.224 --> 36:57.976
Thank you for upholding justice
for me, Your Highness.

37:15.039 --> 37:15.880
Duke Xianguo.

37:16.280 --> 37:17.320
You may rise as well.

37:18.280 --> 37:19.480
The guests are all waiting.

37:19.880 --> 37:21.599
It's time for me
to change into my costume.

37:23.039 --> 37:24.760
Go back and watch the play.

37:25.280 --> 37:28.239
Think carefully about what justice
and righteousness truly mean.

37:28.719 --> 37:29.280
I

37:29.880 --> 37:30.960
shall obey Your Highness.

37:51.119 --> 37:51.920
Duke Xianguo.

37:52.320 --> 37:53.199
Let's go back.

38:18.400 --> 38:19.920
The play has already started.

38:20.519 --> 38:21.840
Why are you still here?

38:22.559 --> 38:24.960
Don't you want to see my performance?

38:25.079 --> 38:27.320
I was worried
Your Highness might summon me.

38:32.719 --> 38:47.480
♪My resentment cannot be quelled♪

38:56.400 --> 39:05.679
- Bravo!
- Bravo!

39:12.900 --> 39:19.900
(Bring Honor to Forebears
and Prosperity to Descendants)

39:20.260 --> 39:21.850
(Zheng Yun, Zheng Baichuan's Second Son)

39:21.864 --> 39:24.060
(Fifth-Rank Patrol Officer
of the Rear Military Command)

39:41.880 --> 39:43.230
No need to see me off, Butler Fu.

39:43.920 --> 39:45.159
Take care, Commander Lin.

39:47.880 --> 39:49.360
We're here to escort the bride.

39:49.599 --> 39:50.920
Take care, Commander Liu.

39:50.960 --> 39:51.679
I can still drink.

39:51.719 --> 39:53.039
Take care, Squad Leader Sun.

39:59.039 --> 39:59.800
Wait.

40:03.280 --> 40:04.079
Liu Xiaochuan.

40:04.152 --> 40:05.976
Don't you dare throw up in my carriage.

40:07.559 --> 40:08.519
Sorry.

40:10.119 --> 40:11.130
Did I say you could leave?

40:11.140 --> 40:12.870
A good dog knows
when to get out of the way!

40:12.880 --> 40:13.679
You...

40:14.119 --> 40:14.880
Yun.

40:14.880 --> 40:15.840
Come.

40:16.440 --> 40:17.239
Sorry.

40:17.912 --> 40:19.400
He's had too much to drink.

40:19.519 --> 40:20.990
He didn't recognize you.

40:21.000 --> 40:21.980
For the sake of the Yuan

40:22.110 --> 40:23.752
and Lin families'
joyous occasion today,

40:24.119 --> 40:25.000
please let this go.

40:25.760 --> 40:26.920
When he sobers up tomorrow,

40:27.016 --> 40:28.500
I'll have him host a proper banquet

40:28.510 --> 40:29.768
and make a proper apology.

40:30.232 --> 40:32.150
For the Crown Prince's safety,
everyone entering

40:32.184 --> 40:34.070
or leaving here
must be thoroughly searched.

40:35.128 --> 40:36.670
Anyone who refuses to cooperate

40:37.079 --> 40:38.400
is to be arrested immediately.

40:38.679 --> 40:39.519
Yes.

40:39.639 --> 40:40.000
Yes.

40:41.800 --> 40:44.360
But for Commander Lin's sake today,

40:45.079 --> 40:46.880
I'll let them off for now.

40:48.639 --> 40:49.440
Thank you, Yun.

40:50.000 --> 40:50.480
Thank you.

40:51.840 --> 40:54.159
Then we won't keep you
from your official duties.

40:54.440 --> 40:55.320
We'll be on our way.

40:55.510 --> 40:56.808
Let's meet another day.

41:16.719 --> 41:20.599
- Good!
- Good!

41:21.480 --> 41:24.239
♪The mirror of justice
shines through the ages♪

41:24.599 --> 41:28.840
♪All schemes shall come to nothing♪

41:30.239 --> 41:31.719
♪In this court♪

41:31.719 --> 41:34.239
♪State your name♪

41:34.599 --> 41:37.280
♪I am the Mountain Deity♪

41:38.719 --> 41:43.119
♪Everything you have done
has come before my eyes♪

41:43.599 --> 41:46.440
♪Guo Qiu abuses his power♪

41:46.719 --> 41:50.599
♪And commits evil deeds,
earning everyone's hatred♪

41:57.360 --> 41:59.639
♪Today I have descended
from the mountain♪

41:59.920 --> 42:03.000
♪To clear Tanniang's name♪

42:03.360 --> 42:06.079
♪What say you?♪

42:06.599 --> 42:10.320
♪The Mountain Deity's
will shall be obeyed♪

42:10.400 --> 42:13.320
♪Guards, release Tanniang at once♪

42:13.480 --> 42:14.719
♪Take Guo Qiu away♪

42:20.719 --> 42:21.400
Your Highness!

42:22.440 --> 42:23.440
Protect His Highness!

42:27.760 --> 42:28.599
What's going on?

42:32.280 --> 42:33.119
Guards, quickly!

42:35.559 --> 42:37.000
Your Highness! Protect His Highness!

42:39.119 --> 42:39.960
Move aside!

42:57.800 --> 42:58.719
Zheng Baichuan!

42:59.880 --> 43:01.039
Are you rebelling?

43:04.980 --> 43:07.420
=Against the Current=
(Next Episode's Preview)

43:08.920 --> 43:11.800
By the Mandate of Heaven, the Emperor

43:12.159 --> 43:13.239
hereby decrees.

43:13.840 --> 43:17.079
Lin Jinqi, Commander
of the Shence Garrison,

43:17.120 --> 43:18.408
has served the realm with loyalty

43:18.424 --> 43:20.890
and rendered meritorious service
in protecting the Emperor.

43:21.159 --> 43:22.760
As he has reached the age of marriage,

43:23.440 --> 43:25.840
a virtuous lady
shall be chosen as his wife.

43:26.000 --> 43:29.039
Xu, daughter of Xu Wanquan,

43:29.360 --> 43:31.039
is gentle and kind,

43:31.719 --> 43:33.440
virtuous and accomplished.

43:34.039 --> 43:36.199
To bring about this worthy union,

43:36.840 --> 43:40.039
she is hereby bestowed
in marriage to Lin Jinqi.

43:59.100 --> 44:03.220
♪Spring slips from the
branches once more♪

44:06.060 --> 44:10.580
♪Flowers bloom unseen,
as they have before♪

44:11.860 --> 44:15.780
♪All the joys and sorrows come and go♪

44:16.460 --> 44:19.220
♪While loss leaves winter in the heart♪

44:19.940 --> 44:22.260
♪Though all the world may fade♪

44:22.260 --> 44:25.340
♪Time rolls on as
countless lives rush by♪

44:26.860 --> 44:31.100
♪Night winds wander
through the halls of long ago♪

44:34.020 --> 44:38.180
♪No page could hold the
longing words can never show♪

44:39.980 --> 44:43.540
♪Every joy and sorrow
in this fleeting life♪

44:43.540 --> 44:47.100
♪Fades into the past
as new wounds rise♪

44:47.900 --> 44:53.580
♪While whispers of perfume
linger beneath the eaves♪

44:53.940 --> 44:58.260
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

44:58.620 --> 45:01.580
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:01.580 --> 45:05.340
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:05.340 --> 45:08.220
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:08.220 --> 45:12.300
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:12.300 --> 45:15.660
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:15.660 --> 45:19.420
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:19.420 --> 45:23.420
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪

45:24.180 --> 45:28.340
♪Let the cold wind rage,
let the wild rain fall♪

45:28.340 --> 45:31.780
♪Let sorrow spill like shadows over all♪

45:31.780 --> 45:35.420
♪Let love fall to pieces,
let old anger burn away♪

45:35.420 --> 45:38.300
♪Let the past die with yesterday♪

45:38.300 --> 45:42.380
♪One last fire, one last cup of wine♪

45:42.380 --> 45:45.740
♪And silver moonlight to
guide me through the night♪

45:45.740 --> 45:49.380
♪Let beginnings fade
as endings come to call♪

45:49.380 --> 45:57.180
♪From this endless dream,
there's no return at all♪
